<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Recipes on 牛马日志</title><link>https://leru-sama.github.io/recipe/</link><description>Recent content in Recipes on 牛马日志</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.147.4</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 20:31:49 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://leru-sama.github.io/recipe/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>葱烧鸡腿</title><link>https://leru-sama.github.io/recipe/%E8%91%B1%E7%83%A7%E9%B8%A1%E8%85%BF/</link><pubDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 20:31:49 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://leru-sama.github.io/recipe/%E8%91%B1%E7%83%A7%E9%B8%A1%E8%85%BF/</guid><description>&lt;p>鸡腿切块，拍碎的姜，生抽，盐，抓粘后放面粉抓拌均匀腌制。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>大葱葱白切滚刀，葱绿随便切&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>起锅烧油，小火煎姜、葱绿、花椒熬出葱油。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>取出之前加的东西，放蒜炸香。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>取出蒜，放鸡腿，煎一会放料酒生抽白糖&lt;/li>
&lt;li>放蒜炒两下加一点点清水&lt;/li>
&lt;li>煮一会，收汁到差不多，放葱白&lt;/li>
&lt;li>葱白不要煮太熟，稍微炒两下就出锅&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item></channel></rss>